# TWRP runs in the recovery domain. The recovery policy denies it most of what it needs
# (mkdir in /, its own properties, backlight sysfs, vndbinder), which made TWRP abort in a
# restart loop with a blank screen. init isn't allowed to setenforce either, so make the
# recovery domain permissive. recovery_only() keeps this out of any non-recovery policy.
recovery_only(`
permissive recovery;
')
